But the safest way to make `npm ci --ignore-scripts` succeed without touching code: add `overrides` in root package.json. But `overrides` only overrides dependency versions, not peerDependencies. To override peer deps, npm supports nesting the peer dep version. E.g.:

```
"overrides": {
  "react-custom-scrollbars": {
    "react": "$react"
  }
}
```

