Actually a simpler override that works: since the conflict is peer react range, npm overrides can override the peerDependency spec. npm docs: "You may also override the version of a peer dependency." So:

```
"overrides": {
  "react-custom-scrollbars": {
    "react": "^17.0.0"
  }
}
```

